327
00:13:58,670 --> 00:13:59,890
Deputy Court Pres. Yu?

328
00:13:59,890 --> 00:14:01,280
The designation is yet to be announced.

329
00:14:01,280 --> 00:14:03,000
But the matter wouldn't have been resolved

330
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,400
so smoothly without him.

331
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:08,040
I know you must feel wronged.

332
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:09,800
In one year

333
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:11,000
or two at most,

334
00:14:11,690 --> 00:14:13,440
I hope you will still return to working

335
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,970
in the Intermediate Court.

336
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:18,720
Thank you, Court President.

337
00:14:19,270 --> 00:14:21,270
Thanks to Deputy Court Pres. Yu too.

338
00:14:23,110 --> 00:14:23,760
Oh, right.

339
00:14:24,390 --> 00:14:26,030
If it's not too much trouble for you,

340
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:27,430
