350
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:45,640
It gave me the creeps.

351
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:50,580
Xia, make yourself at home.

352
00:14:50,750 --> 00:14:52,390
H-Help yourself to some water.

353
00:14:52,390 --> 00:14:53,590
