359
00:14:59,870 --> 00:15:01,510
Then do you know how to chop vegetables?

360
00:15:01,510 --> 00:15:02,980
Chop those green peppers for me.

361
00:15:02,980 --> 00:15:03,840
I've washed them already.

362
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:04,570
Okay, got it.

363
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:09,120
How very odd.

364
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:11,080
At first,

365
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:12,570
I was really scared.

366
00:15:12,910 --> 00:15:13,730
I felt like

367
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:15,000
