368
00:15:15,510 --> 00:15:17,360
But after talking to the Court President,

369
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,640
even to my own surprise,

370
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:19,670
the heavy burden in my heart

371
00:15:19,670 --> 00:15:20,510
was lifted.

372
00:15:20,870 --> 00:15:22,870
A new chapter in my life just began.

373
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,510
Why was that?

374
00:15:26,040 --> 00:15:27,520
Maybe deep down,

375
00:15:27,550 --> 00:15:28,170
I've already

376
00:15:28,170 --> 00:15:29,570
