377
00:15:30,390 --> 00:15:32,080
You don't want to be a judge?

378
00:15:32,110 --> 00:15:32,790
Why?

379
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:35,540
I don't like it, and I'm not good at it.

380
00:15:35,770 --> 00:15:36,690
I just wanted to

381
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:38,360
