385
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:48,960
You can drink a bit, huh?

386
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:49,320
Yes.

387
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:52,940
Come on, let's have a drink.

388
00:15:53,150 --> 00:15:53,630
Here you are.

389
00:15:53,630 --> 00:15:54,200
Thanks.

390
00:15:59,260 --> 00:16:00,320
Come on, cheers.

391
00:16:00,510 --> 00:16:00,840
Sure.

392
00:16:04,790 --> 00:16:05,670
Dig in.

393
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:11,840
However, I still

394
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:13,880
feel sorry for you.

395
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:20,720
Xia.

396
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,120
You know what?

397
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,400
After my husband passed,

398
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:29,970
I felt like my life was over too.

399
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:32,320
I had no life of my own,

400
00:16:33,030 --> 00:16:34,290
or happiness of my own.

401
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:38,200
It was like I spent the past ten-odd years

402
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:40,060
carrying his dead body on my back.

403
00:16:47,390 --> 00:16:48,520
But now, all is fine.

404
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:50,000
My career is over,

405
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:51,320
