409
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:00,720
It's okay.

410
00:17:01,790 --> 00:17:02,720
I really am fine.

411
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:04,740
Actually, I'm quite pleased.

412
00:17:05,510 --> 00:17:06,589
I've decided

413
00:17:08,349 --> 00:17:09,550
