425
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:35,920
But he declined.

426
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:38,860
Thank you, Mei.

427
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:41,490
However,

428
00:17:42,510 --> 00:17:44,840
these are the consequences I should bear.

429
00:17:45,740 --> 00:17:46,870
For what it's worth,

430
00:17:47,270 --> 00:17:48,830
moving on from the past,

431
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,510
finding new life goals,

432
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:52,960
and charting a new course for yourself

433
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:54,760
matter more than anything else.

434
00:17:55,470 --> 00:17:56,470
I'm happy for you!

435
00:17:56,720 --> 00:17:57,160
Yes.

436
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:59,040
That's also what I think.

437
00:18:09,350 --> 00:18:10,880
I really owe you a thank you.

438
00:18:14,540 --> 00:18:15,670
Actually, it was you

439
00:18:18,310 --> 00:18:19,440
who changed my mind.

440
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:24,060
I even bought sleeping pills.

441
00:18:27,830 --> 00:18:29,430
After my husband's passing,

442
00:18:31,550 --> 00:18:33,010
I thought no one in the rest

443
00:18:34,270 --> 00:18:35,480
of my life would ever say

444
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,540
what you said to me.

445
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:42,240
"I swear to share the woes with you."

446
00:18:49,850 --> 00:18:51,590
Although you failed to exonerate

447
00:18:51,590 --> 00:18:52,610
Qian Xingliang,

448
00:18:54,270 --> 00:18:55,200
you did save me.

449
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:01,050
You are a good judge.

450
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:07,180
Come on.

451
00:19:11,510 --> 00:19:12,710
Keep up the good work.

452
00:19:12,790 --> 00:19:13,770
Be a good judge.

453
00:19:14,510 --> 00:19:14,880
Xia.

454
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:18,480
I will.

455
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:19,480
Keep it up.

456
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:21,510
I will.

457
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:24,850
I definitely will.

458
00:19:25,960 --> 00:19:27,020
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

459
00:19:40,070 --> 00:19:41,200
Leave the door open.

460
00:19:48,790 --> 00:19:49,440
Well,

461
00:19:50,510 --> 00:19:52,160
I've talked to Court Pres. Sun

462
00:19:52,160 --> 00:19:53,490
of Guding County Court.

463
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:54,590
If you meet any difficulties,

464
00:19:54,590 --> 00:19:56,250
feel free to tell him anytime.

465
00:19:58,000 --> 00:19:58,790
Who gave you the authority

466
00:19:58,790 --> 00:20:00,250
to interfere with my work?

467
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:02,800
I no longer report to you.

468
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:04,410
Haven't you realized that?

469
00:20:06,550 --> 00:20:07,790
It was Court Pres. Qiu's idea.

470
00:20:07,790 --> 00:20:09,000
He was worried that you couldn't adapt

471
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:12,030
at the grassroots level,
since you're a female comrade.

472
00:20:12,030 --> 00:20:13,920
It's not like I never stayed in Nanyu.

473
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:16,580
You are not assigned
to the Guding County Court,

474
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:17,570
but further down

475
00:20:18,620 --> 00:20:20,350
to Dashijia Village Tribunal.

476
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:27,160
The chief judge there is an old man
surnamed Hu.

477
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,590
He's probably too busy
with farm work lately

478
00:20:28,590 --> 00:20:29,720
to have time for you.

479
00:20:33,590 --> 00:20:35,250
Yingjie, we are schoolmates,

480
00:20:37,130 --> 00:20:37,880
and the only ones

481
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:38,740
who know each other best here.

482
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:39,940
So, I just meant to...

483
00:20:43,760 --> 00:20:44,920
Forget it. Never mind.

484
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:46,050
I'll leave you to it.

485
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:48,580
Have I told you?

486
00:20:50,790 --> 00:20:52,850
A few years ago, I paid a visit to Lihui

487
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:55,260
at Xijiang Province Bieshan Prison.

488
00:20:55,680 --> 00:20:57,480
Why did you suddenly bring it up?

489
00:20:58,440 --> 00:20:59,640
Compared to Bieshan,

490
00:21:00,590 --> 00:21:02,320
wherever the court assigns me,

491
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:05,370
I'd see it as a privilege
and a training opportunity.

492
00:21:06,830 --> 00:21:08,030
I should be grateful.

493
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:23,500
The 1979 Criminal Law
and Criminal Procedure Law,

494
00:21:23,500 --> 00:21:25,020
as New China's

495
00:21:23,970 --> 00:21:27,040
[National Symposium on Legal Revision]

496
00:21:25,070 --> 00:21:27,240
first Criminal Law
and Criminal Procedure Law,

497
00:21:27,040 --> 00:21:29,020
[Chen Yizhong]

498
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:29,640
once played a positive role

499
00:21:29,640 --> 00:21:31,030
in the society

500
00:21:31,030 --> 00:21:33,030
and the building of the legal system.

501
00:21:33,030 --> 00:21:34,750
With the development of the times,

502
00:21:34,750 --> 00:21:35,880
their limitations

503
00:21:36,030 --> 00:21:37,830
have inevitably emerged.

504
00:21:38,320 --> 00:21:39,310
Given that, it is our belief

505
00:21:39,310 --> 00:21:40,480
that the Criminal law
and the Criminal Procedure Law

506
00:21:40,480 --> 00:21:42,010
should be both overhauled.

507
00:21:42,400 --> 00:21:43,410
In amending the law,

508
00:21:43,410 --> 00:21:44,690
some legal concepts

509
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:46,550
should be brought light on.

510
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:49,440
Only by making up for all

511
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:50,440
the shortcomings

512
00:21:50,690 --> 00:21:52,590
will the Criminal Law
and the Criminal Procedure Law

513
00:21:52,590 --> 00:21:54,450
be considered relatively sound.

514
00:21:56,510 --> 00:21:58,030
But we must note that the revision

515
00:21:58,030 --> 00:21:58,960
has to be aligned

516
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:00,830
with China's actual conditions.

517
00:22:00,830 --> 00:22:01,720
We must be cautious

518
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:03,120
and proceed step by step.

519
00:22:10,310 --> 00:22:11,110
Yizhong,

520
00:22:11,590 --> 00:22:14,320
the journey of amending the law
is long and rough.

521
00:22:15,440 --> 00:22:16,480
What you consider

522
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:17,790
as basic concepts

523
00:22:18,510 --> 00:22:19,680
are probably

524
00:22:20,960 --> 00:22:22,160
beyond common sense,

525
00:22:22,590 --> 00:22:23,590
challenging

526
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:26,680
the existing knowledge system,

527
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:27,540
and even absurd

528
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:28,580
and rebellious

529
00:22:28,640 --> 00:22:30,100
in the eyes of some people.

530
00:22:30,480 --> 00:22:31,200
Besides,

531
00:22:33,510 --> 00:22:34,680
we are not saints.

532
00:22:37,010 --> 00:22:37,690
What we say

533
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:39,180
may not be always correct.

534
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:40,830
Some things

535
00:22:41,270 --> 00:22:42,470
make sense in theory,

536
00:22:43,030 --> 00:22:44,560
but when put into practice,

537
00:22:45,160 --> 00:22:46,360
they just don't work.

538
00:22:49,350 --> 00:22:50,950
Any undertaking takes time.

539
00:22:57,880 --> 00:22:59,210
We're revising the law,

540
00:23:01,310 --> 00:23:03,170
a vital instrument for the state.

541
00:23:06,110 --> 00:23:07,910
So we must be extremely prudent.

542
00:23:23,420 --> 00:23:25,220
Are you here to gain experience?

543
00:23:25,680 --> 00:23:26,200
No.

544
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:29,660
I'm here for making a mistake.

545
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:30,940
What kind of a mistake?

546
00:23:31,270 --> 00:23:32,800
I disregarded a human life.

547
00:23:36,270 --> 00:23:37,750
Just a mistake.

548
00:23:38,590 --> 00:23:39,720
Alright, sit tight.

549
00:23:39,920 --> 00:23:41,250
The road ahead is bumpy.

550
00:23:47,070 --> 00:23:47,750
Here she comes.

551
00:23:47,750 --> 00:23:48,410
She's here.

552
00:23:49,240 --> 00:23:50,170
She's arriving?

553
00:23:55,460 --> 00:23:56,400
Thanks for the ride.

554
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:57,060
No problem.

555
00:23:57,510 --> 00:23:58,170
Sir, thanks

556
00:23:58,240 --> 00:23:59,040
for your work!

557
00:23:59,310 --> 00:23:59,810
No problem.

558
00:23:59,810 --> 00:24:00,370
Hello.

559
00:24:00,400 --> 00:24:02,030
Hello. You must be Judge Xia, right?

560
00:24:02,030 --> 00:24:02,610
Yes, I am.

561
00:24:02,720 --> 00:24:03,980
My name is Hu Xingwang.

562
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:05,130
I'm also a judge here.

563
00:24:05,130 --> 00:24:05,880
Hello, Judge Hu.

564
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:06,610
Hello to you.

565
00:24:06,830 --> 00:24:07,790
This is my wife.

566
00:24:08,510 --> 00:24:09,370
Hello, Mrs. Hu.

567
00:24:09,430 --> 00:24:09,910
Hello.

568
00:24:10,070 --> 00:24:11,600
That's my eldest grandson.

569
00:24:11,610 --> 00:24:13,000
And that's my eldest granddaughter.

570
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:13,960
Hello, ma'am!

571
00:24:13,960 --> 00:24:14,620
Hello.

572
00:24:14,800 --> 00:24:16,110
Let's help you settle down first.

573
00:24:16,110 --> 00:24:17,310
I'll have my wife prepare

574
00:24:17,310 --> 00:24:18,270
a simple meal later.

575
00:24:18,270 --> 00:24:19,350
We'll make do for now.

576
00:24:19,350 --> 00:24:20,790
I-I'd hate to let you
go to so much trouble.

577
00:24:20,790 --> 00:24:21,590
No, not at all.

578
00:24:22,070 --> 00:24:23,400
I'm not able to cook much,

579
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:24,670
but some noodles.

580
00:24:24,790 --> 00:24:25,070
Come on.

581
00:24:25,070 --> 00:24:25,940
Okay. I'm fine with anything.

582
00:24:25,940 --> 00:24:27,240
I'll take your luggage. Let's go.

583
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:27,750
No need.

584
00:24:27,750 --> 00:24:28,200
I can carry it myself.

585
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:29,240
Alright, this way.

586
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:29,840
Fair skin.

587
00:24:30,070 --> 00:24:30,510
So...

588
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:31,680
fair!

589
00:24:32,430 --> 00:24:33,290
Such fair skin!

590
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:35,000
What's that gibberish?

591
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:35,510
Yin Ping,

592
00:24:35,510 --> 00:24:36,770
don't you mess around!

593
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:41,510
Don't be afraid.

594
00:24:41,510 --> 00:24:42,440
Though he's demented,

595
00:24:42,440 --> 00:24:43,700
he never hurts anyone.

596
00:24:44,110 --> 00:24:44,640
Let's go.

597
00:24:44,880 --> 00:24:45,480
Follow up.

598
00:25:01,590 --> 00:25:02,850
Zhou and Cheng

599
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:03,640
were right.

600
00:25:05,110 --> 00:25:07,030
We aren't doing what we're supposed to.

601
00:25:07,030 --> 00:25:08,880
What professionals are we?

602
00:25:09,400 --> 00:25:11,030
We still have to suck it all up, don't we?

603
00:25:11,030 --> 00:25:11,960
You deserve it.

604
00:25:12,550 --> 00:25:14,150
You are obsessed with money.

605
00:25:17,110 --> 00:25:17,710
I'm tired.

606
00:25:19,830 --> 00:25:22,070
Exhausted, I'd say. I want a break.

607
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:24,160
Listen,

608
00:25:24,510 --> 00:25:25,480
you should quickly

609
00:25:25,480 --> 00:25:26,480
get your act together

610
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:28,410
and take over Mr. Yuan's position.

611
00:25:28,960 --> 00:25:30,690
Get down to some real business.

612
00:25:31,110 --> 00:25:32,880
The new Criminal Procedure Law
is about to take effect.

613
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:33,640
Your win rate will be

614
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:34,700
higher, I suppose.

615
00:25:37,310 --> 00:25:39,920
I know you're giving me good advice
through sarcastic remarks,

616
00:25:39,920 --> 00:25:42,030
but I still won't jump on
that sinking ship.

617
00:25:42,030 --> 00:25:44,070
If Mr. Yuan's today

618
00:25:44,270 --> 00:25:45,270
is my tomorrow,

619
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:47,070
then I'd rather swallow my pride.

620
00:25:47,070 --> 00:25:48,000
Continue to drink then.

621
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,350
You don't seem very tired to me.

622
00:25:49,350 --> 00:25:50,680
Fine. I'll have a drink.

623
00:25:53,800 --> 00:25:54,960
You called me out
in the middle of the night.

624
00:25:54,960 --> 00:25:56,820
Whose life are you trying to save?

625
00:26:01,070 --> 00:26:02,270
I'm getting married.

626
00:26:02,400 --> 00:26:03,800
She gave me an ultimatum.

627
00:26:04,440 --> 00:26:06,040
Isn't my life going to an end?

628
00:26:08,070 --> 00:26:09,270
Who are you marrying?

629
00:26:11,160 --> 00:26:12,560
Still that girl named...

630
00:26:13,880 --> 00:26:14,410
Ding Rui?

631
00:26:14,590 --> 00:26:15,790
What do you mean by "still"?

632
00:26:15,790 --> 00:26:17,480
Would I dare to have her replaced?

633
00:26:17,480 --> 00:26:19,320
Although Ding Zhongxiang
is about to retire,

634
00:26:19,320 --> 00:26:20,200
it's still no difficult job

635
00:26:20,200 --> 00:26:21,500
for him to get a gun and hunt me down

636
00:26:21,500 --> 00:26:22,160
in Beijing.

637
00:26:24,340 --> 00:26:26,160
If you're getting cold feet
and deciding to

638
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:27,220
be irresponsible,

639
00:26:27,510 --> 00:26:28,440
then I can't help you.

640
00:26:28,440 --> 00:26:30,970
Irresponsible? Help? What's that nonsense?

641
00:26:32,400 --> 00:26:34,110
Y-You have to help me, though.

642
00:26:34,510 --> 00:26:36,310
I'd like to invite everyone over

643
00:26:36,640 --> 00:26:37,170
to Nanyu.

644
00:26:38,830 --> 00:26:39,440
For what?

645
00:26:39,920 --> 00:26:41,580
To help you propose marriage?

646
00:26:42,920 --> 00:26:43,750
Imagine this.

647
00:26:45,960 --> 00:26:47,960
Twelve years after our graduation,

648
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:49,830
while commemorating the past

649
00:26:49,830 --> 00:26:51,200
and looking forward to the future,

650
00:26:51,200 --> 00:26:53,070
we are holding an epoch-making

651
00:26:53,240 --> 00:26:55,640
wedding of the century at the place

652
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:57,070
where our dreams began.

653
00:27:06,750 --> 00:27:07,200
Hello.

654
00:27:08,240 --> 00:27:08,950
Zeming.

655
00:27:11,640 --> 00:27:13,100
You're holding a wedding?

656
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:14,840
Sounds great.

657
00:27:16,790 --> 00:27:17,510
But I doubt if I can

658
00:27:17,510 --> 00:27:18,710
attend it on that day.

659
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:20,270
Yes.

660
00:27:20,750 --> 00:27:22,380
I've just been assigned to a new post.

661
00:27:22,380 --> 00:27:23,780
There's a lot on my plate.

662
00:27:24,680 --> 00:27:25,750
I'll make it up to you.

663
00:27:25,750 --> 00:27:28,010
I'll send you a red envelope first, okay?

664
00:27:31,310 --> 00:27:33,590
Yingjie works at the grassroots level now.

665
00:27:33,590 --> 00:27:35,050
Completely overwhelmed.

666
00:27:35,050 --> 00:27:35,480
Tell you what,

667
00:27:35,480 --> 00:27:36,880
I'll call you back later.

668
00:27:37,760 --> 00:27:39,190
That's bullshit!

669
00:27:39,210 --> 00:27:40,650
It happened because you did a bad job

670
00:27:40,650 --> 00:27:41,510
building that fence!

671
00:27:41,510 --> 00:27:43,070
Even a mule could get through it!

672
00:27:43,070 --> 00:27:45,440
How could you blame
that old yellow ox of mine?

673
00:27:45,440 --> 00:27:45,840
You...

674
00:27:46,110 --> 00:27:47,570
Defendant, watch your language.

675
00:27:47,570 --> 00:27:48,960
You heartless creature!

676
00:27:48,960 --> 00:27:50,690
Who are you calling heartless?

677
00:27:54,480 --> 00:27:56,000
Keep your composure. Let them fight.

678
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:57,270
Let's resume the trial
when they get tired.

679
00:27:57,270 --> 00:27:58,050
How's that a good idea?

680
00:27:58,050 --> 00:27:59,180
It works. It's okay.

681
00:28:00,270 --> 00:28:01,530
You are unreasonable!

682
00:28:04,350 --> 00:28:05,350
Court adjourned!

683
00:28:08,160 --> 00:28:08,990
Are you done fighting?

684
00:28:08,990 --> 00:28:09,480
Enough!

685
00:28:12,720 --> 00:28:13,720
No more fighting!

686
00:28:14,160 --> 00:28:15,750
Xia! A phone call for you!

687
00:28:16,110 --> 00:28:16,790
Coming right up!

688
00:28:16,790 --> 00:28:17,160
A phone call for you!

689
00:28:17,160 --> 00:28:17,690
Sit down!

690
00:28:17,790 --> 00:28:19,310
This is a court. Do you know?

691
00:28:19,310 --> 00:28:20,270
Hit him! Go!

692
00:28:24,510 --> 00:28:25,110
Hello.

693
00:28:25,240 --> 00:28:25,640
Hello.

694
00:28:26,310 --> 00:28:27,370
It's Chen Yizhong.

695
00:28:27,960 --> 00:28:28,760
Chen Yizhong?

696
00:28:29,800 --> 00:28:31,320
H-How did you figure out

697
00:28:31,350 --> 00:28:32,110
this number?

698
00:28:32,680 --> 00:28:34,070
I got anxious when I couldn't reach you.

699
00:28:34,070 --> 00:28:35,670
So I asked Lu for your number.

700
00:28:36,830 --> 00:28:37,640
You haven't given me

701
00:28:37,640 --> 00:28:39,000
a single call for two years.

702
00:28:39,000 --> 00:28:40,730
But suddenly, a call right now?

703
00:28:41,510 --> 00:28:43,050
H-How have you been?

704
00:28:43,160 --> 00:28:44,030
Are you doing okay?

705
00:28:44,030 --> 00:28:44,890
I'm doing fine.

706
00:28:45,830 --> 00:28:46,690
What about you?

707
00:28:48,070 --> 00:28:48,790
I...

708
00:28:50,310 --> 00:28:51,440
I wrote you a letter.

709
00:28:54,070 --> 00:28:56,030
Oh, yes, right, I read it.

710
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:01,270
Is there a matter?

711
00:29:02,030 --> 00:29:02,550
Yes.

712
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:05,260
Lu is getting married.

713
00:29:05,720 --> 00:29:06,480
He hopes...

714
00:29:06,590 --> 00:29:08,250
we can all attend his wedding.

715
00:29:08,480 --> 00:29:09,640
Really?

716
00:29:10,270 --> 00:29:11,510
He's marrying that girl...

717
00:29:11,510 --> 00:29:12,470
Ding Rui, right?

718
00:29:13,170 --> 00:29:14,070
I didn't expect Lu

719
00:29:14,070 --> 00:29:15,440
to be this devoted.

720
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:17,060
How admirable.

721
00:29:17,240 --> 00:29:18,640
Congratulations to him.

722
00:29:19,160 --> 00:29:20,350
Right. H-He plans to hold

723
00:29:20,350 --> 00:29:21,550
the wedding in Nanyu.

724
00:29:21,960 --> 00:29:22,480
Now...

725
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:24,680
He's inviting the few of us over.

726
00:29:24,830 --> 00:29:26,640
A-Are you going?

727
00:29:28,270 --> 00:29:28,920
Why didn't he

728
00:29:28,920 --> 00:29:29,920
call me himself?

729
00:29:30,510 --> 00:29:31,710
I stopped him.

730
00:29:31,730 --> 00:29:33,930
I thought I must fight for such an honor.

731
00:29:34,590 --> 00:29:35,590
Cut it out.

732
00:29:38,110 --> 00:29:39,030
I can't make it.

733
00:29:40,070 --> 00:29:40,720
Why?

734
00:29:41,590 --> 00:29:42,990
Look, Yu can't go either.

735
00:29:43,350 --> 00:29:44,680
Zhang Lihui is far away.

736
00:29:45,830 --> 00:29:47,160
So I'll have to go alone?

737
00:29:47,680 --> 00:29:49,010
Too bad for Lu, isn't it?

738
00:29:49,270 --> 00:29:50,590
Hell no.

739
00:29:56,000 --> 00:29:56,720
Well...

740
00:30:01,030 --> 00:30:03,160
Actually, I miss you a lot.

741
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:25,160
Oh you.

742
00:30:25,750 --> 00:30:26,350
You...

743
00:30:27,400 --> 00:30:28,480
How could you

744
00:30:28,480 --> 00:30:29,830
bring that up

745
00:30:29,830 --> 00:30:31,000
over a phone call?

746
00:30:31,400 --> 00:30:33,180
You hadn't contacted her for years.

747
00:30:33,180 --> 00:30:33,880
And you said you like her

748
00:30:33,880 --> 00:30:34,900
on a sudden phone call?

749
00:30:34,900 --> 00:30:36,100
So abrupt, wasn't it?

750
00:30:36,440 --> 00:30:37,400
I didn't say I like her.

751
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:38,710
You didn't? W-What

752
00:30:38,830 --> 00:30:40,680
was the point of all that?

753
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:42,250
I had it all planned out.

754
00:30:42,310 --> 00:30:43,750
I meant to tell her I like her

755
00:30:43,750 --> 00:30:44,590
and see if I stood a chance

756
00:30:44,590 --> 00:30:46,190
after getting my doctorate.

757
00:30:46,310 --> 00:30:48,000
That's only your plan, isn't it?

758
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:48,720
Do you even know

759
00:30:48,720 --> 00:30:49,880
her current situation,

760
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:50,590
how she feels,

761
00:30:50,590 --> 00:30:51,790
or what her plans are?

762
00:30:55,400 --> 00:30:56,460
I want to go see her.

763
00:30:58,600 --> 00:31:00,240
Are you quitting the important task

764
00:31:00,240 --> 00:31:01,310
of revising the law?

765
00:31:01,310 --> 00:31:02,310
Right now, I don't want to do anything

766
00:31:02,310 --> 00:31:03,110
but go see her.

767
00:31:03,110 --> 00:31:03,880
You... Then...

768
00:31:03,880 --> 00:31:05,000
you must be drunk, aren't you?

769
00:31:05,000 --> 00:31:05,960
You want to go see her right now?

770
00:31:05,960 --> 00:31:07,240
Aren't you afraid those two old men

771
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:08,310
will skin you alive?

772
00:31:08,310 --> 00:31:09,720
Besides, let me be honest with you.

773
00:31:09,720 --> 00:31:11,450
You two won't last long anyway.

774
00:31:11,590 --> 00:31:13,990
Long-distance relationships never work.

775
00:31:16,270 --> 00:31:17,800
Aren't you in one yourself?

776
00:31:17,880 --> 00:31:18,270
I...

777
00:31:19,960 --> 00:31:21,240
I'm no ordinary man,

778
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:22,000
am I?

779
00:31:27,240 --> 00:31:28,590
You know nothing, lad.

780
00:31:29,920 --> 00:31:30,350
What?

781
00:31:32,240 --> 00:31:32,770
Hey, Rui.

782
00:31:34,000 --> 00:31:34,350
Yes.

783
00:31:34,660 --> 00:31:36,560
I'm with Yizhong,

784
00:31:36,590 --> 00:31:38,030
discussing the wedding

785
00:31:38,050 --> 00:31:38,420
now.

786
00:31:39,240 --> 00:31:40,040
Yes, exactly.

787
00:31:40,070 --> 00:31:40,930
Keep it simple.

788
00:31:41,270 --> 00:31:42,790
We'll surely keep it simple.

789
00:31:42,790 --> 00:31:45,200
To comply with the changing customs,
right?

790
00:31:45,200 --> 00:31:46,520
What? How many tables?

791
00:31:46,870 --> 00:31:48,130
Three hundred guests?

792
00:31:49,960 --> 00:31:53,020
What if the Disciplinary Committee
goes after your dad?

793
00:31:53,020 --> 00:31:53,530
No.

794
00:31:54,250 --> 00:31:55,310
Sorry, I was wrong.

795
00:31:57,350 --> 00:31:58,960
Listen.

796
00:32:04,110 --> 00:32:04,950
It hurts so bad.

797
00:32:04,950 --> 00:32:06,210
I just slapped myself.

798
00:32:06,350 --> 00:32:07,830
It hurts a lot. My face turned red.

799
00:32:07,830 --> 00:32:08,310
It's true.

800
00:32:08,310 --> 00:32:09,020
If you don't believe me,

801
00:32:09,020 --> 00:32:09,680
ask Yizhong then.

802
00:32:09,680 --> 00:32:10,480
Right, Yizhong?

803
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:11,130
Right?

804
00:32:13,960 --> 00:32:14,640
Yes, he did.

805
00:32:15,810 --> 00:32:16,830
Everyone has their match.

806
00:32:16,830 --> 00:32:18,240
Let's not judge each other.

807
00:32:18,240 --> 00:32:19,090
Yes, yes.

808
00:32:20,960 --> 00:32:21,350
Okay.

809
00:32:22,160 --> 00:32:23,490
It's all up to you, okay?

810
00:32:23,720 --> 00:32:24,400
Let's do

811
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:25,600
whatever you decide.

812
00:32:26,830 --> 00:32:27,160
Sure.

813
00:32:27,720 --> 00:32:28,160
Mr. Lu,

814
00:32:28,440 --> 00:32:29,310
sorry to keep you waiting.

815
00:32:29,310 --> 00:32:29,960
Honey,

816
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:30,790
I have to go.

817
00:32:30,810 --> 00:32:32,010
I'm getting busy now.

818
00:32:34,310 --> 00:32:35,270
Long time no see!

819
00:32:39,680 --> 00:32:40,200
Mentor.

820
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:42,400
You were absent for days.

821
00:32:42,830 --> 00:32:44,830
Yes. I went back home for a few days,

822
00:32:45,350 --> 00:32:46,750
sent my wife and granddaughter

823
00:32:46,750 --> 00:32:47,880
back to downtown, and got them

824
00:32:47,880 --> 00:32:48,510
settled.

825
00:32:49,830 --> 00:32:51,830
We're in for a long battle after all.

826
00:32:52,790 --> 00:32:54,510
Had better get everything together
at the base.

827
00:32:54,510 --> 00:32:55,590
What long battle?

828
00:32:56,310 --> 00:32:57,550
I agree with you.

829
00:32:58,290 --> 00:32:59,490
This is highly likely

830
00:32:59,790 --> 00:33:01,120
a wrongful conviction.

831
00:33:02,030 --> 00:33:02,510
Lihui,

832
00:33:02,960 --> 00:33:04,420
no prosecutor wants to see

833
00:33:04,500 --> 00:33:06,130
a wrongful conviction

834
00:33:06,160 --> 00:33:07,420
happen on their watch.

835
00:33:07,970 --> 00:33:09,480
Also, no prosecutor hates to

836
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:11,280
overturn a wrongful conviction

837
00:33:11,350 --> 00:33:12,550
with their own hands.

838
00:33:13,400 --> 00:33:14,930
I want to overturn this one.

839
00:33:16,110 --> 00:33:17,640
Okay. I'll be with you on it.

840
00:33:17,960 --> 00:33:18,680
How naive!

841
00:33:19,900 --> 00:33:21,160
Do you know how much effort

842
00:33:21,160 --> 00:33:22,630
and time it takes

843
00:33:22,650 --> 00:33:23,930
to overturn a conviction?

844
00:33:23,930 --> 00:33:25,310
I can afford it. But can you?

845
00:33:25,310 --> 00:33:26,240
You're too young.

846
00:33:26,240 --> 00:33:27,070
Of course I can.

847
00:33:27,070 --> 00:33:27,940
I must join you in it.

848
00:33:27,940 --> 00:33:28,830
Don't argue with me!

849
00:33:28,830 --> 00:33:29,920
I'm almost 60 years old.

850
00:33:29,920 --> 00:33:31,200
I've spent half my life

851
00:33:31,240 --> 00:33:32,590
in this godforsaken place.

852
00:33:32,590 --> 00:33:33,850
I'll be retiring soon.

853
00:33:34,450 --> 00:33:35,350
I don't want to end up

854
00:33:35,350 --> 00:33:36,210
accomplishing nothing.

855
00:33:36,210 --> 00:33:37,440
I made all these arrangements

856
00:33:37,440 --> 00:33:38,750
just to force you to leave.

857
00:33:38,750 --> 00:33:39,350
Tomorrow,

858
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:40,780
you must leave!

859
00:33:51,830 --> 00:33:52,360
What now?

860
00:33:55,160 --> 00:33:55,720
Mentor.

861
00:33:57,550 --> 00:33:58,210
I... I can't

862
00:34:00,270 --> 00:34:01,530
bring myself to leave.

863
00:34:03,510 --> 00:34:04,510
In my heart,

864
00:34:04,880 --> 00:34:05,940
you've always been

865
00:34:06,110 --> 00:34:07,310
a father figure to me.

866
00:34:10,630 --> 00:34:12,030
I grew up without family.

867
00:34:13,230 --> 00:34:15,630
I don't even know
what my father looks like.

868
00:34:16,230 --> 00:34:17,150
If asked what a father

869
00:34:17,150 --> 00:34:18,150
should be like,

870
00:34:19,320 --> 00:34:20,440
I'd say you.

871
00:34:22,840 --> 00:34:23,770
I refuse to leave

872
00:34:24,630 --> 00:34:26,690
definitely not because of that case,

873
00:34:27,480 --> 00:34:29,389
but because I want to stick with you.

874
00:34:29,389 --> 00:34:30,440
I can't desert you

875
00:34:30,440 --> 00:34:31,150
here.

876
00:34:35,030 --> 00:34:35,800
Sorry.

877
00:34:40,400 --> 00:34:42,199
Fine then. I'll leave tomorrow.

878
00:34:45,590 --> 00:34:46,230
I know

879
00:34:46,840 --> 00:34:47,400
you're able to

880
00:34:47,400 --> 00:34:49,460
overturn the conviction on your own.

881
00:34:52,150 --> 00:34:53,080
I believe in you.

882
00:35:13,760 --> 00:35:14,290
Let's go.

883
00:35:14,880 --> 00:35:16,210
Can you give me a moment?

884
00:35:16,410 --> 00:35:16,670
Okay.

885
00:35:16,670 --> 00:35:16,920
Sure.

886
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:17,520
Thank you.

887
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:27,440
Lihui!

888
00:35:28,600 --> 00:35:29,000
Lihui.

889
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:29,600
Slow down.

890
00:35:29,800 --> 00:35:30,400
I'm fine.

891
00:35:31,290 --> 00:35:33,330
Mentor, Yan Jicai

892
00:35:33,360 --> 00:35:34,600
is emotionally unstable.

893
00:35:34,600 --> 00:35:35,880
When you talk to him again,

894
00:35:35,880 --> 00:35:36,920
try to be careful.

895
00:35:38,710 --> 00:35:40,110
Plus, don't forget to take

896
00:35:40,110 --> 00:35:41,570
your hypertensive drugs.

897
00:35:41,960 --> 00:35:42,440
Got it.

898
00:35:44,230 --> 00:35:45,190
Your coughing hasn't

899
00:35:45,190 --> 00:35:46,250
gotten any better.

900
00:35:46,400 --> 00:35:47,030
You should have

901
00:35:47,030 --> 00:35:48,690
a proper checkup at some time.

902
00:35:50,230 --> 00:35:50,760
Alright.

903
00:35:52,230 --> 00:35:53,160
I'm leaving now.

904
00:35:53,630 --> 00:35:54,070
Lihui!

905
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:57,340
I just submitted a report,

906
00:35:57,760 --> 00:35:59,590
saying there's no substitution yet,

907
00:35:59,590 --> 00:36:01,450
so you have to stay a longer while.

908
00:36:02,280 --> 00:36:03,800
If they pressure you,

909
00:36:04,190 --> 00:36:05,450
just say it's my fault.

910
00:36:08,000 --> 00:36:08,710
Really?

911
00:36:08,730 --> 00:36:09,360
Really.

912
00:36:10,320 --> 00:36:10,850
You sure?

913
00:36:11,190 --> 00:36:12,590
I'm absolutely sure.

914
00:36:13,030 --> 00:36:14,280
You crooked old man,

915
00:36:14,280 --> 00:36:16,110
why not tell me earlier?

916
00:36:16,230 --> 00:36:16,880
It hurts!

917
00:36:16,880 --> 00:36:17,940
Get my luggage back!

918
00:36:17,940 --> 00:36:19,030
-I will!
-You go do it!

919
00:36:19,030 --> 00:36:20,000
What does this mean?

920
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:21,330
I came for nothing then.

921
00:36:21,710 --> 00:36:23,170
A trip in vain. No big deal.

922
00:36:23,590 --> 00:36:24,790
Come on, hand it to me.

923
00:36:30,710 --> 00:36:32,910
I'm going on a trip for work
in a few days.

924
00:36:33,150 --> 00:36:33,760
Where to?

925
00:36:34,320 --> 00:36:34,800
Nanyu.

926
00:36:36,840 --> 00:36:37,960
What for?

927
00:36:38,220 --> 00:36:40,220
That place has nothing to do with us.

928
00:36:40,360 --> 00:36:42,160
Lu's getting married, isn't he?

929
00:36:43,070 --> 00:36:44,670
You call that a trip for work?

930
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:46,880
We didn't hold a wedding back then.

931
00:36:46,880 --> 00:36:47,630
Now that he has invited me,

932
00:36:47,630 --> 00:36:49,230
it would be impolite not to show up,
right?

933
00:36:49,230 --> 00:36:51,090
Just think of it as a trip for work.

934
00:36:52,630 --> 00:36:54,590
It wasn't I who didn't want a wedding.

935
00:36:54,590 --> 00:36:56,120
Maybe you felt a bit uneasy.

936
00:36:58,880 --> 00:37:00,320
Everyone said I was marrying up.

937
00:37:00,320 --> 00:37:00,850
Was there

938
00:37:01,280 --> 00:37:02,150
even a point of holding

939
00:37:02,150 --> 00:37:02,750
a wedding?

940
00:37:03,630 --> 00:37:04,690
Let me ask you then.

941
00:37:05,510 --> 00:37:07,310
What about after my dad retired?

942
00:37:07,320 --> 00:37:08,480
For so long, have you ever

943
00:37:08,480 --> 00:37:09,760
taken me to dinner with your

944
00:37:09,760 --> 00:37:10,400
schoolmates,

945
00:37:10,400 --> 00:37:11,940
friends and colleagues,

946
00:37:12,230 --> 00:37:14,160
or formally introduced me to them?

947
00:37:15,070 --> 00:37:15,840
Are you worried about

948
00:37:15,840 --> 00:37:16,670
being laughed at

949
00:37:16,670 --> 00:37:18,530
now that my dad can't support you?

950
00:37:18,670 --> 00:37:19,930
It was I who married up,

951
00:37:20,400 --> 00:37:21,660
Deputy Court Pres. Yu.

952
00:37:23,320 --> 00:37:23,630
Fang Haohao,

953
00:37:23,630 --> 00:37:24,830
is this how you see me?

954
00:37:30,360 --> 00:37:32,360
Xia Yingjie will be there too, right?

955
00:37:32,360 --> 00:37:32,890
Perfect.

956
00:37:33,710 --> 00:37:34,840
Revisit the town with her then.

957
00:37:34,840 --> 00:37:36,570
I've noticed that recently...

958
00:37:45,510 --> 00:37:46,550
Keep talking to me this way.

959
00:37:46,550 --> 00:37:47,380
Neurotic, paranoid.

960
00:37:47,380 --> 00:37:50,110
There'll be problems between us
sooner or later.

961
00:38:02,070 --> 00:38:03,000
Things weren't like now when we

962
00:38:03,000 --> 00:38:04,130
first got together.

963
00:38:07,630 --> 00:38:08,690
I'm not going then.

964
00:38:18,880 --> 00:38:20,010
When is the wedding?

965
00:38:20,590 --> 00:38:21,070
The 8th.

966
00:38:35,170 --> 00:38:38,540
[Nanyu County People's Court,
People's Procuratorate]

967
00:38:38,490 --> 00:38:39,220
Judge Zhang,

968
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:40,920
thank you.

969
00:38:42,880 --> 00:38:44,710
I had given up hope.

970
00:38:45,320 --> 00:38:46,110
But the file

971
00:38:46,840 --> 00:38:48,500
was surprisingly recovered.

972
00:38:54,800 --> 00:38:56,730
This is what I thought at that time.

973
00:38:58,230 --> 00:39:00,110
Even if the file had gone missing,

974
00:39:00,360 --> 00:39:02,620
it couldn't have been just yours, right?

975
00:39:02,960 --> 00:39:04,890
It's not like you are some big shot.

976
00:39:05,320 --> 00:39:07,280
A large batch of files must have been

977
00:39:07,280 --> 00:39:08,630
misplaced somewhere.

978
00:39:09,000 --> 00:39:09,800
Fortunately,

979
00:39:10,150 --> 00:39:11,350
a few days ago in town,

980
00:39:11,480 --> 00:39:12,590
expired files were being disposed of.

981
00:39:12,590 --> 00:39:13,990
So I looked through them.

982
00:39:14,440 --> 00:39:15,670
I was just in luck.

983
00:39:18,110 --> 00:39:18,840
Judge Zhang,

984
00:39:19,670 --> 00:39:21,550
you gave me a second life.

985
00:39:22,440 --> 00:39:24,030
It's been over ten years.

986
00:39:24,590 --> 00:39:24,880
Get up.

987
00:39:24,880 --> 00:39:25,940
More than a decade.

988
00:39:29,030 --> 00:39:31,030
You're a grown man. Stop crying.

989
00:39:33,440 --> 00:39:35,030
It's not like I've done nothing

990
00:39:35,030 --> 00:39:36,000
but look for your file

991
00:39:36,000 --> 00:39:37,590
over these ten-odd years.

992
00:39:40,590 --> 00:39:41,790
Recovering this file

993
00:39:42,360 --> 00:39:43,220
is only a start.

994
00:39:43,920 --> 00:39:44,650
You need to do

995
00:39:45,320 --> 00:39:46,720
the next steps yourself.

996
00:39:47,880 --> 00:39:49,480
Find your former colleagues

997
00:39:49,550 --> 00:39:51,550
and ask them for their testimonies.

998
00:39:52,390 --> 00:39:54,870
They were the ones who falsely
accused me of cooking the books.

999
00:39:54,870 --> 00:39:56,470
How could I ask them for help?

1000
00:39:57,760 --> 00:39:58,710
W-Will

1001
00:39:59,440 --> 00:40:00,320
this work?

1002
00:40:03,590 --> 00:40:04,000
Well,

1003
00:40:04,840 --> 00:40:06,170
then tell them straight

1004
00:40:06,190 --> 00:40:07,480
that the case has exceeded the statutory

1005
00:40:07,480 --> 00:40:08,510
limitation period

1006
00:40:08,510 --> 00:40:09,770
and cannot be retried.

1007
00:40:10,190 --> 00:40:10,880
Besides,

1008
00:40:11,410 --> 00:40:13,150
the books you handled back then
do not reflect

1009
00:40:13,150 --> 00:40:14,670
professionalism or completion.

1010
00:40:14,670 --> 00:40:15,530
Tell them not to

1011
00:40:15,960 --> 00:40:17,760
worry about legal liabilities.

1012
00:40:21,550 --> 00:40:24,210
Also, don't think about
seeking compensation.

1013
00:40:25,110 --> 00:40:26,310
All you should demand

1014
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:28,190
is a statement so as to clear

1015
00:40:28,190 --> 00:40:28,800
your name.

1016
00:40:29,670 --> 00:40:30,470
Yes, exactly.

1017
00:40:31,000 --> 00:40:32,360
Just a statement.

1018
00:40:34,510 --> 00:40:36,140
I have nothing left in my life

1019
00:40:37,400 --> 00:40:38,800
but my innocence.

1020
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:41,150
No need to see me out.

1021
00:40:41,150 --> 00:40:41,880
Hey, old bud.

1022
00:40:44,440 --> 00:40:45,050
Mentor!

1023
00:40:45,380 --> 00:40:46,070
Mentor.

1024
00:40:46,190 --> 00:40:47,250
It's you, Yizhong!

1025
00:40:48,630 --> 00:40:49,400
Give me a hug.

1026
00:40:50,480 --> 00:40:50,800
Mentor.

1027
00:40:50,800 --> 00:40:51,510
A hug, huh?

1028
00:40:52,120 --> 00:40:53,530
You're as strong as ever.

1029
00:40:54,440 --> 00:40:55,000
Yes, I'm doing great.

1030
00:40:55,000 --> 00:40:55,730
Judge Zhang.

1031
00:40:55,920 --> 00:40:56,920
I'm leaving then.

1032
00:41:00,400 --> 00:41:01,000
Take care.

1033
00:41:05,550 --> 00:41:07,110
Mentor, h-he's that...

1034
00:41:07,110 --> 00:41:07,590
Yes.

1035
00:41:10,230 --> 00:41:11,560
He drops by once a month.

1036
00:41:11,840 --> 00:41:12,800
Mentor has chatted with him

1037
00:41:12,800 --> 00:41:13,920
for ten-odd years.

1038
00:41:18,480 --> 00:41:19,710
He's aged quite a bit.

1039
00:41:20,480 --> 00:41:22,010
Almost all his hair's gone.

1040
00:41:23,550 --> 00:41:24,590
Look at me.

1041
00:41:24,800 --> 00:41:26,660
I'm in a much worse shape than him!

1042
00:41:26,720 --> 00:41:27,440
You're different.

1043
00:41:27,440 --> 00:41:28,900
You look younger this way.

1044
00:41:29,110 --> 00:41:30,040
Listen to him...

1045
00:41:30,670 --> 00:41:32,400
Good for you, kid.

1046
00:41:32,520 --> 00:41:34,890
You've learned to be cheesy too.

1047
00:41:37,400 --> 00:41:38,400
How have you been?

1048
00:41:38,670 --> 00:41:40,070
Things haven't been easy

1049
00:41:40,190 --> 00:41:41,790
in these ten-odd years, huh?

1050
00:41:43,710 --> 00:41:44,840
I've been learning.

1051
00:41:45,800 --> 00:41:46,880
But I do have regrets.

1052
00:41:46,880 --> 00:41:48,630
I wish I had understood earlier

1053
00:41:49,360 --> 00:41:50,890
the many things you told me.

1054
00:41:54,190 --> 00:41:55,960
I heard from Zeming about the case

1055
00:41:55,960 --> 00:41:57,220
you tried in Binjiang.

1056
00:41:58,590 --> 00:42:00,720
Yizhong, you should think it this way.

1057
00:42:01,360 --> 00:42:02,020
If that case

1058
00:42:02,030 --> 00:42:03,960
had been tried ten years ago
anywhere else,

1059
00:42:03,960 --> 00:42:06,690
the ruling would be a death sentence
all the same.

1060
00:42:07,630 --> 00:42:09,190
Fortunately, the legal system

1061
00:42:09,190 --> 00:42:10,320
is still improving.

1062
00:42:10,920 --> 00:42:12,000
Some costs

1063
00:42:12,510 --> 00:42:13,590
are inevitable.

1064
00:42:14,510 --> 00:42:16,370
It is difficult for an individual

1065
00:42:17,150 --> 00:42:19,230
to break through
the limitations of the times.

1066
00:42:19,230 --> 00:42:19,960
Do you get it?

1067
00:42:21,590 --> 00:42:22,070
Anyway,

1068
00:42:22,670 --> 00:42:23,800
we must look forward

1069
00:42:23,880 --> 00:42:25,210
and focus on the future.

1070
00:42:26,590 --> 00:42:27,850
I understand all that.

1071
00:42:28,850 --> 00:42:29,960
Yu has also told me they are

1072
00:42:29,960 --> 00:42:31,480
trying to figure something out,

1073
00:42:31,480 --> 00:42:33,210
seeing if the sentence could be

1074
00:42:33,400 --> 00:42:34,510
changed or reduced.

1075
00:42:34,510 --> 00:42:36,630
You see, just as I said,

1076
00:42:37,120 --> 00:42:38,160
justice delayed

1077
00:42:38,190 --> 00:42:39,920
is better than justice denied.

1078
00:42:42,550 --> 00:42:43,150
Lu Zeming!

1079
00:42:43,920 --> 00:42:44,580
Be careful.

1080
00:42:44,880 --> 00:42:47,080
Your father-in-law is looking for you.

1081
00:42:47,590 --> 00:42:49,480
I-Is he looking for me happily

1082
00:42:49,510 --> 00:42:50,960
or angrily?

1083
00:42:52,740 --> 00:42:54,000
Has he ever been happy?

1084
00:42:55,450 --> 00:42:56,460
Off you go!

1085
00:42:57,670 --> 00:42:59,320
-You...
-Just you go.

1086
00:42:59,320 --> 00:43:00,650
I-I'll have to take off.

1087
00:43:01,280 --> 00:43:01,810
Let's go.

1088
00:43:01,980 --> 00:43:02,670
To my office.
